<title>USA: Advantage Bancorp Inc Q4 Sept 30 loss.</title>
<headline>Advantage Bancorp Inc Q4 Sept 30 loss.</headline>
<dateline>KENOSHA, Wis. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.02   profit	 $0.56</p>
<p> Net loss		   3,675   profit	 2,077</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Fiscal 1996 Q4, year results include one-time charge of $2.8 million, or $0.77/shr after-tax, for Savings Association Insurance Fund recapitalization and a charge of $3.0 million, or $0.82/shr after-tax, for writedown of intangible assets.  </p>
<p>		     YEAR</p>
<p> Shr profit		$ 0.83   profit	 $2.20</p>
<p> Net profit		 3,033   profit	 8,151</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Excluding one-time charges, 1996 results were earnings of $0.56/shr in Q4 and earnings of $2.39/shr for the full year.</p>
<p>Assets: $1.02 billion vs $973.2 million</p>
<p>Deposits: $680.9 million vs $681.9 million</p>
<p>Loans receivable: $562.8 million vs $512.3 million</p>
